{
  "name": "Vuelve · Reactivación de clientes dormidos",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reactivación de clientes dormidos (mensual)\n\n1. Duplica la hoja `Contactos` con estas columnas:\n   `nombre | telefono | mesesSinContacto | servicio | consent | estado`\n   - `consent` = SI/NO (MARKETING exige consentimiento)\n   - `estado` = dormido / activo\n2. En n8n: Settings → Variables → `WA_PHONE_NUMBER_ID` y `WA_TOKEN`\n   (o sustituye `{{$env.X}}` por credenciales de n8n).\n3. Sustituye TU_ID_DE_GOOGLE_SHEET en el nodo de Google Sheets.\n4. Revisa el límite diario: WhatsApp aguanta ~1.000 contactos/día (tier 1).",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "nota-1",
      "name": "Instrucciones",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-520, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "month",
              "triggerAtDay": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 10,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-1",
      "name": "Cada mes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-300, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": "TU_ID_DE_GOOGLE_SHEET",
        "sheetName": "Contactos",
        "options": { "headerRow": true }
      },
      "id": "sheets-1",
      "name": "Leer contactos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [-80, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-consent",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.consent }}",
              "rightValue": "SI",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            },
            {
              "id": "c-dormido",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.estado }}",
              "rightValue": "dormido",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            },
            {
              "id": "c-meses",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.mesesSinContacto }}",
              "rightValue": 6,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gte" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filtro-1",
      "name": "Filtrar dormidos con consentimiento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [140, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 10,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "lotes-1",
      "name": "Dividir en lotes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [360, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Prepara la plantilla aprobada de reactivación.\n// Los parámetros van en el mismo orden que en Meta: {{1}} nombre, {{2}} meses, {{3}} negocio.\nconst negocio = $env.NEGOCIO || 'tu negocio';\nreturn items.map((item) => {\n  const nombre = String(item.json.nombre || 'cliente').trim().split(' ')[0];\n  const meses = Number(item.json.mesesSinContacto || 0);\n  const telefono = String(item.json.telefono || '').replace(/\\D/g, '');\n  const cuerpo = `Hola ${nombre}, hace ${meses} meses que no nos llamabas desde ${negocio}. Queríamos saber como va tu instalación y si sigue funcionando bien. Si te apetece, te preparamos la revision de mantenimiento. Te viene bien?`;\n  return {\n    json: {\n      payload: {\n        messaging_product: 'whatsapp',\n        to: telefono,\n        type: 'template',\n        template: {\n          name: 'reactivacion_cliente',\n          language: { code: 'es' },\n          components: [\n            {\n              type: 'body',\n              parameters: [\n                { type: 'text', text: nombre },\n                { type: 'text', text: String(meses) },\n                { type: 'text', text: negocio }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      },\n      telefono,\n      nombre,\n      meses,\n      cuerpo\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "codigo-1",
      "name": "Preparar mensaje",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [580, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/{{ $env.WA_PHONE_NUMBER_ID }}/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.WA_TOKEN }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.payload) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 30000, "response": { "response": { "neverError": false } } }
      },
      "id": "http-1",
      "name": "Enviar WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [800, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": { "amount": 3, "unit": "seconds" },
      "id": "wait-1",
      "name": "Esperar 3 s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1020, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": "TU_ID_DE_GOOGLE_SHEET",
        "sheetName": "Envios",
        "columns": "telefono,nombre,plantilla,fecha,estado,error",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-2",
      "name": "Registrar envío",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [1240, -120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "fin-1",
      "name": "Fin",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [580, 140]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Cada mes": { "main": [[{ "node": "Leer contactos", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Leer contactos": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Filtrar dormidos con consentimiento", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Filtrar dormidos con consentimiento": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Dividir en lotes", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Dividir en lotes": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Fin", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Preparar mensaje", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Preparar mensaje": { "main": [[{ "node": "Enviar WhatsApp", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Enviar WhatsApp": { "main": [[{ "node": "Esperar 3 s", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Esperar 3 s": { "main": [[{ "node": "Registrar envío", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Registrar envío": { "main": [[{ "node": "Dividir en lotes", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {}
}
